  "result": "The repository's rules don't answer this. Nothing in `AGENTS.md`, `README.md`, or the use-case briefs mentions a Manager role, an approval limit, or what happens after a refused approval. The only roles are Approver and Admin.\n\nThe code shows one related behavior. In `ApprovalService.Approve` (`backend/src/InvoiceApp.Domain/ApprovalService.cs:31-41`), `EnsurePending` throws before any state change, and `_repository.Update` is never reached. So a refused approval leaves the invoice in PendingApproval, with no status change, decider, or timestamp recorded. The rules don't say whether a refusal should be logged or audited.",
